  triage:title "AC8 AO2.12-contract cross-reference is module comment, not per-class docstrings" ;
  triage:description "Sprint AO2.11 Acceptance Criterion 8 (docs/plans/phase-ao2/sprint-AO2-11-benchmark-rendering-pipeline.md line 134-135) requires HistoricalRecord classes in benchmark_schema.py to be field-for-field equal to AO2.12\'s normative contract (docstring cross-references it). Found by req-qa (ATM-QA-005): the cross-reference is implemented as a module-level comment rather than per-class docstrings. quality-mgr independently cross-checked the fields against sprint-AO2-12-historical-data-migration.md and confirmed they match exactly — this is cosmetic documentation-placement, not a contract violation." ;
